{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/31903fcad513fb9436c399ab040a1e9b.avif?t=1769096694\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/a74607177acbb096f4545c81857589dc.avif?t=1769096694\" width=768 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/74a48073dfeb8e20a3ae82a097e30724.poster.avif?t=1769096694\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/74a48073dfeb8e20a3ae82a097e30724.webm?t=1769096694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/74a48073dfeb8e20a3ae82a097e30724.mp4?t=1769096694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into dangerous biomes where waves of all kinds of monsters will try to bring you down. To survive, you\u2019ll need to build a solid defense with strategically placed turrets. But survival isn\u2019t enough\u2026 you can strike back in a unique way! Every enemy monster can be captured and turned into part of your defensive card deck. Harness their powers and abilities, combine monsters and turrets, and discover the best synergies to overcome the challenges of each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/cfbb3b4a0b107030dabc4f917fa4aef3.avif?t=1769096694\" width=768 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/2a8bf05f2752af06fc74198aba934bc0.poster.avif?t=1769096694\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/2a8bf05f2752af06fc74198aba934bc0.webm?t=1769096694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/2a8bf05f2752af06fc74198aba934bc0.mp4?t=1769096694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each wave, you\u2019ll have the chance to expand the terrain, creating a map that grows larger and longer with every step, forcing enemies to take more challenging paths. Each expansion is generated randomly, ensuring that no two runs are ever the same. On top of that, biomes can change from match to match, altering both the look of the environment and the types of monsters that appear. Every attempt becomes a truly unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/b3f4cd5c9f6460a6ef66c25c279d5cde.avif?t=1769096694\" width=768 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/101f16afc42adbb2d64e379dd788d290.poster.avif?t=1769096694\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/101f16afc42adbb2d64e379dd788d290.webm?t=1769096694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/101f16afc42adbb2d64e379dd788d290.mp4?t=1769096694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is home to 70 different monsters and 10 unique turrets. As you encounter them in battle, your Monster Book will gradually fill with new entries: every creature you face will be recorded with its description and stats. Defeat and capture monsters to unlock even more details, including how many times you\u2019ve bested or captured them. Becoming a true monster master means completing every last page of this book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Book Smart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930410/320406e2df5012be4a0de58b457d1976b68d31cf.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Charged","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930410/9384589e6a478fc0921bdc822c0a0c4711fa64e7.jpg"},{"name":"Deep Dive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930410/e03ce01968702c710856222d8e59aa9629e2f016.jpg"},{"name":"Too Hot to Fail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930410/a9f4f865f9148634815f2bbe9c2ea75483b9045c.jpg"},{"name":"Photosynthesis Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930410/637a4014f6eda34f9d6189d81cec6f0626f63ecb.jpg"},{"name":"Hard as Stone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930410/58409fb709ca3588876f5ec4996d898efb53081f.jpg"},{"name":"Nothing but Air","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930410/68024d63a047e55ce0cf1019c21f322ebeb1a6fa.jpg"},{"name":"Highly Contagious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930410/a067ec5ad3862d12482b61dfe5faa289d5441ba8.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Monsters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930410/933e3b0eec83f0d5274c3276e7f05ae84315b8b0.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930410?t=1769096694","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930410?t=1769096694","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/38bfc24de1abfc8e93db67c482acd9e24eaf76fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769096694","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/38bfc24de1abfc8e93db67c482acd9e24eaf76fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769096694","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/31903fcad513fb9436c399ab040a1e9b.avif?t=1769096694\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/a74607177acbb096f4545c81857589dc.avif?t=1769096694\" width=768 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/74a48073dfeb8e20a3ae82a097e30724.poster.avif?t=1769096694\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/74a48073dfeb8e20a3ae82a097e30724.webm?t=1769096694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/74a48073dfeb8e20a3ae82a097e30724.mp4?t=1769096694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into dangerous biomes where waves of all kinds of monsters will try to bring you down. To survive, you\u2019ll need to build a solid defense with strategically placed turrets. But survival isn\u2019t enough\u2026 you can strike back in a unique way! Every enemy monster can be captured and turned into part of your defensive card deck. Harness their powers and abilities, combine monsters and turrets, and discover the best synergies to overcome the challenges of each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/cfbb3b4a0b107030dabc4f917fa4aef3.avif?t=1769096694\" width=768 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/2a8bf05f2752af06fc74198aba934bc0.poster.avif?t=1769096694\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/2a8bf05f2752af06fc74198aba934bc0.webm?t=1769096694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/2a8bf05f2752af06fc74198aba934bc0.mp4?t=1769096694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each wave, you\u2019ll have the chance to expand the terrain, creating a map that grows larger and longer with every step, forcing enemies to take more challenging paths. Each expansion is generated randomly, ensuring that no two runs are ever the same. On top of that, biomes can change from match to match, altering both the look of the environment and the types of monsters that appear. Every attempt becomes a truly unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/b3f4cd5c9f6460a6ef66c25c279d5cde.avif?t=1769096694\" width=768 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/101f16afc42adbb2d64e379dd788d290.poster.avif?t=1769096694\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/101f16afc42adbb2d64e379dd788d290.webm?t=1769096694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/extras/101f16afc42adbb2d64e379dd788d290.mp4?t=1769096694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is home to 70 different monsters and 10 unique turrets. As you encounter them in battle, your Monster Book will gradually fill with new entries: every creature you face will be recorded with its description and stats. Defeat and capture monsters to unlock even more details, including how many times you\u2019ve bested or captured them. Becoming a true monster master means completing every last page of this book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Betaking Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930410/15e27906865bd2371d11b4e70e1b07f9e823c303/header.jpg?t=1769096694","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930410/241476788/fda9be3c6ee1563b262f7c2f1ab0954d5a8fbb55/1761565448/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761565897","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930410/241476788/fda9be3c6ee1563b262f7c2f1ab0954d5a8fbb55/1761565448/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761565897","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.stea